      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess. but it doesnt feel like a \"chapter\". it feels like the end. like once that version of me was erased, the thing that made me *me* died. now im just this... leftover shell. there's nothing inside to rebuild. how can there be a \"new version\" when the core of who i was is literally gone? it's like trying to rebuild a house after the ground it stood on has been swallowed by the ocean.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
